# The date dimension — the universal dimension

## One row per day, pre-built

- Grain = **one calendar day**, populated once, ahead of time
- Surrogate key = **`YYYYMMDD` integer** — `20260724`

```
date_key  full_date  month_name quarter year is_holiday
20260724  2026-07-24 July       3       2026 false
```

## Why a table, not `MONTH()`

- **Business calendar** — `is_holiday`, `fiscal_year`, `fiscal_quarter`
- **Consistent labels** — every report agrees on `month_name`
- **Ready attributes** — `is_weekend`, `week_of_year`, no date logic
- **Fast integer joins** on a 4-byte key

## Conformed **and** role-playing

- Shared by every fact · `order_date` / `ship_date` / `delivery_date`
